Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.92,0:00:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.82,0:01:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Fightin' God!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.38,0:01:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the top of the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.70,0:01:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.61,0:01:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He's heading down to the\Ncrypt to escape from the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.34,0:01:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.25,0:01:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:02:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati must have fastened\Nthe brooch to the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.72,0:02:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, sorry to bother you,\Nbut could you pass me the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.96,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling parched.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But remember, we must tread carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.78,0:02:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We have very strict orders to remain right
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.14,0:02:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,here on the boat and\Nto stay off the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what the reason. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.54,0:02:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.45,0:02:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what you just\Ncouldn't help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.84,0:02:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you give it back before I start?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with all that\Nsticky goop on your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.70,0:02:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well as if playing stupid\Nis gonna fool anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.74,0:02:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you have a chance\Nto stuff your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.92,0:02:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There was no time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, did I thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.06,0:02:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You know for the bottle of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.82,0:02:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's refreshing. What
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.64,0:02:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Something bizarre is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on\Nhere, but I've got a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.22,0:03:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.48,0:03:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What part of our order to not\Ndisembark was confusing to you? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.82,0:03:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We are in deep trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.96,0:03:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The world, it's not working the\Nway it should. Merida! Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.96,0:03:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell? Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.78,0:03:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you? Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.16,0:03:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm already tracking him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.32,0:03:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The brooch tells me his exact location.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.68,0:03:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastard is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.00,0:03:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's currently at the bottom\Nof the stairway to the crypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.62,0:03:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.53,0:03:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's by the pillar\Ntwo meters off the stairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.66,0:03:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't engage him, Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.50,0:03:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what, but something's wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.98,0:03:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, your mission as\Nprotector has been terminated,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.42,0:03:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and your life shall promptly follow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.92,0:04:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cunning little, you're trying\Nto pin down my arm. Superman!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.20,0:04:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But Emperor Crimson has seen through you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.14,0:04:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's peered through time\Nto trace your trajectory,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,the trajectory of your future self.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.48,0:04:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,When Emperor Crimson wields its extraordinary\Npower, time as we know it flits away,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and But all memories formed\Ntherein completely cease to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.82,0:04:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Clouds are torn asunder and know not why.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The flickering flame is blotted away\Nwithout any consciousness of its demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.94,0:05:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All that remains are consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.12,0:05:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The omnipotence of my time obliterating\Npowers renders all action futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.40,0:05:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Only I have the ability to\Nrespond to these actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.84,0:05:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can foretell the exact\Nflavor of your intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.14,0:05:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now feel the power of Emperor Crimson!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This ability...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.52,0:05:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No being is immune to\Nthe peaks and valleys
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,of life as the strong struggle to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,One succeeds while the other fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But with my power, one can gaze upon\Nlife's pitfalls in all their glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sidestepping them becomes but a chore,\Nand life becomes a succession of triumphs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.90,0:06:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A state of personal perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And truly, how could it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.10,0:06:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Having now met you in the flesh,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know beyond a shadow of a doubt\Nthat we are indeed connected by blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel it in my very bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.26,0:06:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You child are my daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.98,0:06:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for you, as long\Nas you continue to draw breath,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.32,0:06:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll also feel the blood\Nconnection the two of us share!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.56,0:06:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall obliterate any\Nperil that stands in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I will sever?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,our familial bond as we speak to Trish!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.22,0:06:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.16,0:06:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Chari.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.28,0:06:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That power is courtesy of Golden Wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.70,0:07:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He implanted the brooch with cells\Nfrom the turtle, giving them new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.58,0:07:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how he was able to\Nreplicate the turtle's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.04,0:07:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we were interrupted, he sensed\Ndanger and activated his ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.66,0:07:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That man never ceases to stoke\Nthe courage within my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I was certain this was\Nthe end, but not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.78,0:07:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have a little\Nbit of fight left in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think my mission's\Ndone, boss, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Our future awaits us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.48,0:07:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As for Trish, she will be\Nprotected under my mandate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.84,0:07:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,he has the power to\Nanticipate all of my attacks
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.84,0:07:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and dodge them before\NI've even realized it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.36,0:07:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.68,0:07:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastard's practically invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.84,0:08:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,However, there is a limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.28,0:08:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He can only read his opponent's\Nmovements in short bursts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.16,0:08:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What a transient trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.06,0:08:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He can cheat time for five to ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.20,0:08:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.24,0:08:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to create more distance between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.74,0:08:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough that the boss can't capture Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.54,0:08:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Bruno. Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Jono's given you an opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.96,0:08:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to get us\Nout of this basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.10,0:08:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems there's another\Ntraitor in our midst.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.54,0:08:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My guess would be the neophyte.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.04,0:08:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Assuming my sources are correct,\Nhis name is Giorno Giovanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.06,0:08:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So he had every intention of betraying\Nme from the very beginning, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.38,0:08:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Charming that you think\Ndistance will aid your escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.12,0:08:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stopping you is as easy as\Nexiting the turtle before you act.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.78,0:08:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You are utterly pathetic, Uchirati.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.40,0:09:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it inner strength that\Nallows you to continue to move?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.54,0:09:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just rest your weary head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.70,0:09:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never reach the first floor,\Nbut you'll be assured a painless end.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.70,0:09:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And Trish will finally meet her maker!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.80,0:09:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now remain still, Uchirati!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.64,0:09:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been given a golden chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.62,0:09:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'd waste it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.04,0:09:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,While you were bragging\Nabout reading my movements,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I took the liberty of reading yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.60,0:09:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you wouldn't just\Ndisappear into the sewers,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.60,0:09:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,not before trying to escape\Nwith your powers! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.86,0:09:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Superman!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.42,0:09:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Emperor Crimson!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.86,0:09:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That was quite the close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.70,0:09:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is the world of Emperor Crimson.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,In this domain, your\Nefforts are forever in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.66,0:09:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your end! Perish!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.62,0:10:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My target wasn't you in the\Nfirst place. It was this pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.82,0:10:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, zipper, close!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.70,0:10:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What I was right one might\Ncall your power invincible
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.56,0:10:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but that same ability\Nalso has Its limitations.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.66,0:10:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not seeing into the\Nfuture, not truly, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I challenge you to predict what\Nmy next move is going to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.88,0:10:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really anyone's guess what\Nthe next few seconds will hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.78,0:10:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I invite you to face the future head-on,\Nas you're greeted by the sight of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.52,0:10:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,while on the ground floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucinati! Trish!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.70,0:10:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This wound!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.16,0:10:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened down in the crypt?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.18,0:10:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.24,0:11:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got to be here, somewhere close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.26,0:11:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what went down,\Nbut one thing's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.14,0:11:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss won't tolerate\Nany act of defiance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.10,0:11:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.60,0:11:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.04,0:11:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.88,0:11:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,His pulse is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.04,0:11:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I made the new park.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.60,0:11:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He should be breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.38,0:11:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.44,0:11:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the Giorno Giovanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.06,0:11:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.22,0:11:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He intended to use his power to give\NBucciarati another chance at life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.06,0:11:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.20,0:11:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It was such a valiant effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.90,0:11:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:12:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The replacement should have worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell doesn't he have a pulse?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.64,0:12:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.10,0:12:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Call the Bakio and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to escape now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.12,0:12:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.00,0:12:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I said to call Abbacchio and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.60,0:12:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.30,0:12:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.32,0:12:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.56,0:12:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Pucinacci, Crazy Dio.\NYou're okay. Forget me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.76,0:12:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Call the others. But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.68,0:12:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,For the time being, the boss's\Nidentity will have to remain a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.42,0:12:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.80,0:12:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lead won't last.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.32,0:12:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're within range. Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.14,0:12:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain everything later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.12,0:12:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.56,0:12:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden win!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.40,0:12:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno's over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.02,0:12:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, get your ass back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.34,0:12:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you think the boss is gonna react
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.24,0:13:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,when he hears you refuse\Nto stay in the boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.70,0:13:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciaranti's here too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.94,0:13:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.44,0:13:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You look awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.44,0:13:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And why is Trish knocked out in your arms?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.44,0:13:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.16,0:13:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting out of this building comes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.76,0:13:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I salute you, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.20,0:13:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly, you are a man\Nof unnerring judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.76,0:13:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I may have the power to\Nobliterate time at my fingertips,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.46,0:13:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but facing six stand users would\Ninevitably review my identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is not the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.60,0:13:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You are fortunate to\Nsurvive Emperor Crimson,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.92,0:13:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but know your fortuitousness\Nwill be short-lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.46,0:13:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear, you shall die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.96,0:13:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Venice will be your watery grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.56,0:13:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured out his twisted method.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.92,0:13:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I now know how he foments\Nfear and clings to power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.62,0:13:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't defeat the boss, not just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.46,0:14:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,His identity...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.86,0:14:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Assuming he has any weaknesses,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.88,0:14:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll need to unveil his flaws\Nbefore trying to take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.98,0:14:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this, Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.56,0:14:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We deserve some answers, so\Nyou better start talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cut to the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.72,0:14:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go into detail, but the\Nfact is we're in terrible danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.38,0:14:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've brought Trish back to us to save her\Nand I've committed to betraying the boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately my friends this\Nis where we part ways if you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.98,0:14:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,choose to join me you'd also\Nbe choosing life on the run
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.90,0:14:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,what are you saying yeah you're\Nnot making any sense I I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.66,0:14:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Think I heard you right. Yes,\Nyou did. He said he's betraying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.44,0:15:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,the boss our boss but but why\Nfor your safety let's end the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,conversation here all I can\Nsay is this is my choice no I
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,really think you should\Nelaborate some of them might want
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.76,0:15:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,to join us if they hear you\Nout and besides we'll need help
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.40,0:15:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,you're a piece of work\NGiorno you know that first
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.54,0:15:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you stormed the tower like\Nyou You own the place,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and now you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mucinati!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.18,0:15:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.36,0:15:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.70,0:15:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.90,0:15:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.96,0:15:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The blood loss made me a\Nlittle dizzy, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.38,0:15:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.96,0:15:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I replaced the wound with healthy\Ntissue and replenished his blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.80,0:15:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What could I have missed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.78,0:15:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just fatigued from this whole ordeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.48,0:15:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't he feel that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.06,0:15:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And for that matter,\Nwhy isn't he bleeding?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.78,0:15:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.04,0:15:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.20,0:15:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You had me worried there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.20,0:16:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no kidding. Please\Ndon't go. Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.80,0:16:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ujarati, at the very least,\Nwe deserve an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.94,0:16:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.08,0:16:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss only had us\Nprotect his daughter so
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.36,0:16:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,that he'd be assured he\Ncould kill her himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.64,0:16:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Due to their connection, she\Nhas insight into his identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.86,0:16:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I learned the truth, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.18,0:16:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew he couldn't be forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.46,0:16:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And I couldn't stand before you\Nand ignore his vile depravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.24,0:16:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to betray him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.18,0:16:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you lost it, Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think I'd ever\Nhave to remind you of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.42,0:16:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know what the\Nboss does to traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.90,0:16:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He punishes all who cross\Nhim without exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.50,0:16:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, for all our group knows, his\Nguards could have this place on lockdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.90,0:16:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, which is why I'm\Ngoing to need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.64,0:17:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you choose to join in this operation,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.84,0:17:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,then descend the stairs\Nand get on the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me be clear, this is not\Nan order, but an invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.02,0:17:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This decision is entirely yours to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.18,0:17:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand what I'm getting myself into,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.66,0:17:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're under no\Nobligation to follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me, I realize how\Nall this must seem to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.18,0:17:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But the actions I take\Nare righteous and just.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.20,0:17:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Though our world is unjust, I will\Nstrive to walk the path I believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.02,0:17:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Our retreat today isn't a defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.62,0:17:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we find his weakness,\NI'll bring down the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.20,0:17:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He will be toppled.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.68,0:18:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.84,0:18:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you're trying\Nto do good, Pucurati.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.66,0:18:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, I have to speak my truth, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.14,0:18:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts to say, but no\None is coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.94,0:18:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you're being so sentimental.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.02,0:18:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you my life, but I\Ncan't be a part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.46,0:18:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost touch with reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.78,0:18:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Lofty ideals alone won't get\Nyou through this difficult life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.38,0:18:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We could never survive without the Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.32,0:18:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You should listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.34,0:18:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You've basically put the\Ngun in your own damn mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.78,0:18:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere you can hide now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.86,0:18:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to live\Nlife always on the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.68,0:18:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, I pledged my loyalties\Nto the Family at large.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.68,0:18:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's not like I ever\Nswore any allegiance to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.14,0:18:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But even so, I've never had\Na place to really call home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A place where I really felt\Nlike I belonged, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.56,0:18:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The only time I've felt at ease is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, when I'm with you, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.68,0:19:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Abacchio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.84,0:19:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.75,0:19:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't! Abacchio!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.02,0:19:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, considering my skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.38,0:19:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,if we get rid of the boss, I'll\Nbe next in line to beat Cabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.42,0:19:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Bucciarati's\Nas smart as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No way in hell he'd take on\Nan opponent he couldn't beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.96,0:19:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be rolling\Nin sweet lira, amico mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.48,0:19:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.68,0:19:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Fugo, what's it gonna\Nbe? You coming with?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.26,0:19:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You've all lost your minds!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.18,0:19:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd be completely isolated!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.00,0:19:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could we possibly run?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.88,0:19:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't even make it\Nout of the city alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.06,0:19:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.84,0:19:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.62,0:19:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What now, Bucciarati? Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.60,0:19:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.00,0:19:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I should go with you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.38,0:20:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you scared? I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.40,0:20:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm honestly scared out of my mind.\NI need an order. Give me an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.16,0:20:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please just tell me to get my\Nass in gear like you always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.82,0:20:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me an order and I\Nwon't be afraid anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.72,0:20:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.06,0:20:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't decide your fate for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.30,0:20:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The choice must be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.66,0:20:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Though we walk this world\Ntogether, your path belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.40,0:20:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But what does all that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.64,0:20:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.84,0:20:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, a word of caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.38,0:20:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay here, Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not your fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.32,0:20:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're serious? You'll\Nend up six feet under?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.64,0:20:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I get what you're doing\Nbut there's some things In
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.48,0:20:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,this world you just can't\Nchange being mafiosi means
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,we can't always take the\Nhigh ground How's this
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.74,0:20:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,mission different from any\Nof the other dirty ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.82,0:20:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't answer that I just know I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,refuse To live a lie let's be off our
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.32,0:21:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,departure will mark the beginning of\Nour lives as traitors to the Mafia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.88,0:21:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on guys, think about\Nwhat you're doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.76,0:21:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We just met this girl, why throw your lives\Naway for someone you know nothing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.06,0:21:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She won't even tell us what\Nkind of music she likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.84,0:21:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She was betrayed by the one she\Nthought she could trust the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.06,0:21:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how she feels, I know that pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.96,0:21:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My own father, the people I thought\Nwere my friends, they abandoned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.14,0:21:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.16,0:21:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We've both been through hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.62,0:21:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The world's kicked both of us\Naround, and so I have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.48,0:21:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonah, the turtle, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.38,0:21:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish can hide inside. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.62,0:21:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You should really take a\Nlook behind you. Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.60,0:22:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going with you! I'm right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.32,0:22:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.30,0:22:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't tell me to stay behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.16,0:22:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish and I are the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.92,0:22:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Her wounds are my wounds! Her pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.74,0:22:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.86,0:22:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, you're turning two.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.76,0:22:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool, you're going to be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.36,0:22:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't be a part of this\Nridiculous game of betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.58,0:22:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be a martyr. I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.04,0:22:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure took your sweet-ass\Ntime getting here, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.22,0:22:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not bitch\Nand moan the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.58,0:22:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.49,0:22:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, you'll forever have\Nmy respect for doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.48,0:22:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Fugo stayed behind after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:22:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that was his decision to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.88,0:23:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, I want to protect\NTrish with everything I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.24,0:23:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear to defeat the boss with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.70,0:23:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.50,0:23:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Squalo?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.64,0:23:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we've got ourselves\Nsome traitors in Venice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.74,0:23:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Their names?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.00,0:23:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Bruno Bucciarati and Giorno Giovanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture them dead or alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.12,0:23:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the boss's direct orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.00,0:24:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
